+              <span style={{ fontSize: "11.5px", color: "#94a3b8", background: "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)", padding: "2px 8px", borderRadius: "4px", border: "1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)" }}>
+                💡 <strong>ドラッグ</strong>で連続選択 / <strong>Shift + ドラッグ</strong>で連続解除
